[Term]
id: DIO:0000224
name: Query and retrieval
def: "Search or query a data resource and retrieve entries and / or annotation."
is_a: DIO:0002409

[Term]
id: DIO:0000226
name: Annotation
def: "Annotate an entity (typically a biological or biomedical database entity) with terms from a controlled vocabulary."

[Term]
id: DIO:0000227
name: Indexing
def: "Generate an index of (typically a file of) biological data."

[Term]
id: DIO:0000230
name: Sequence generation
def: "Generate a molecular sequence by some means."
is_a: DIO:0002403
is_a: DIO:0003429

[Term]
id: DIO:0000231
name: Sequence editing
def: "Edit or change a molecular sequence, either randomly or specifically."
is_a: DIO:0002403
is_a: DIO:0003096

[Term]
id: DIO:0000232
name: Sequence merging
def: "Merge two or more (typically overlapping) molecular sequences."
is_a: DIO:0000231

[Term]
id: DIO:0000233
name: Sequence conversion
def: "Convert a molecular sequence from one type to another."
is_a: DIO:0000231
is_a: DIO:0003434

[Term]
id: DIO:0000234
name: Sequence complexity calculation
def: "Calculate sequence complexity, for example to find low-complexity regions in sequences."
is_a: DIO:0000236

[Term]
id: DIO:0000235
name: Sequence ambiguity calculation
def: "Calculate sequence ambiguity, for example identity regions in protein or nucleotide sequences with many ambiguity codes."
is_a: DIO:0000236

[Term]
id: DIO:0000236
name: Sequence composition calculation
def: "Calculate character or word composition or frequency of a molecular sequence."
is_a: DIO:0002403
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0000237
name: Repeat sequence analysis
def: "Find and/or analyse repeat sequences in (typically nucleotide) sequences."
is_a: DIO:0002403

[Term]
id: DIO:0000238
name: Sequence motif discovery
def: "Discover new motifs or conserved patterns in sequences or sequence alignments (de-novo discovery)."
is_a: DIO:0000253
is_a: DIO:0002404

[Term]
id: DIO:0000239
name: Sequence motif recognition
def: "Find (scan for) known motifs, patterns and regular expressions in molecular sequence(s)."
is_a: DIO:0000253
is_a: DIO:0002404

[Term]
id: DIO:0000240
name: Sequence motif comparison
def: "Find motifs shared by molecular sequences."
is_a: DIO:0002404
is_a: DIO:0002451

[Term]
id: DIO:0000244
name: Simulation analysis
def: "Analyse flexibility and motion in protein structure."
is_a: DIO:0000250

[Term]
id: DIO:0000245
name: Structural motif discovery
def: "Identify or screen for 3D structural motifs in protein structure(s)."
is_a: DIO:0002406
is_a: DIO:0003092

[Term]
id: DIO:0000246
name: Protein domain recognition
def: "Identify structural domains in a protein structure from first principles (for example calculations on structural compactness)."
is_a: DIO:0002406
is_a: DIO:0003092

[Term]
id: DIO:0000247
