def: "Analyse the architecture (spatial arrangement of secondary structure) of protein structure(s)."
is_a: DIO:0002406

[Term]
id: DIO:0000248
name: Residue interaction calculation
def: "Calculate or extract inter-atomic, inter-residue or residue-atom contacts, distances and interactions in protein structure(s)."
is_a: DIO:0000250

[Term]
id: DIO:0000249
name: Protein geometry calculation
def: "Calculate, visualise or analyse phi/psi angles of a protein structure."
is_a: DIO:0000250

[Term]
id: DIO:0000250
name: Protein property calculation
def: "Extract, calculate or predict non-positional (physical or chemical) properties of a protein, including any non-positional properties of the molecular sequence, from processing a protein sequence or 3D structure."
is_a: DIO:0002423
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0000252
name: Peptide immunogenicity prediction
