is_a: DIO:0002423

[Term]
id: DIO:0003501
name: Enrichment analysis
def: "Analysis of a set of objects, such as genes, annotated with given categories, where eventual over-/under-representation of certain categories within the studied set of objects is revealed."
is_a: DIO:0002945

[Term]
id: DIO:0003502
name: Chemical similarity enrichment
def: "Analyse a dataset with respect to concepts from an ontology of chemical structure, leveraging chemical similarity information."
