[Term]
id: DIO:0003503
name: Incident curve plotting
def: "Plot an incident curve such as a survival curve, death curve, mortality curve."
is_a: DIO:0000337

[Term]
id: DIO:0003504
name: Variant pattern analysis
def: "Identify and map patterns of genomic variations."
is_a: DIO:0003197

[Term]
id: DIO:0003552
name: Microscope image visualisation
def: "Visualise images resulting from various types of microscopy."
is_a: DIO:0000337

[Term]
id: DIO:0003553
name: Image annotation
def: "Annotate an image of some sort, typically with terms from a controlled vocabulary."
is_a: DIO:0000226

[Term]
