name: Imputation
def: "Replace missing data with substituted values, usually by using some statistical or other mathematical approach."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0003559
name: Ontology visualisation
def: "Visualise, format or render data from an ontology, typically a tree of terms."
is_a: DIO:0000337

[Term]
id: DIO:0003560
name: Maximum occurrence analysis
def: "A method for making numerical assessments about the maximum percent of time that a conformer of a flexible macromolecule can exist and still be compatible with the experimental data."
is_a: DIO:0000321

[Term]
id: DIO:0003561
name: Database comparison
def: "Compare the models or schemas used by two or more databases, or any other general comparison of databases rather than a detailed comparison of the entries themselves."
is_a: DIO:0002424
is_a: DIO:0002429

[Term]
id: DIO:0003563
name: RNA-seq read count analysis
def: "Analyze read counts from RNA-seq experiments."
is_a: DIO:0003680

[Term]
id: DIO:0003564
name: Chemical redundancy removal
def: "Identify and remove redundancy from a set of small molecule structures."
is_a: DIO:0002483

[Term]
id: DIO:0003565
name: RNA-seq time series data analysis
def: "Analyze time series data from an RNA-seq experiment."
is_a: DIO:0003680

[Term]
id: DIO:0003566
name: Simulated gene expression data generation
def: "Simulate gene expression data, e.g. for purposes of benchmarking."
is_a: DIO:0002426

[Term]
id: DIO:0003625
name: Relation extraction
def: "Identify semantic relations among entities and concepts within a text, using text mining techniques."
is_a: DIO:0000306

[Term]
id: DIO:0003627
name: Mass spectra calibration
def: "Re-adjust the output of mass spectrometry experiments with shifted ppm values."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003628
name: Chromatographic alignment
def: "Align multiple data sets using information from chromatography and/or peptide identification, from mass spectrometry experiments."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003629
name: Deisotoping
def: "The removal of isotope peaks in a spectrum, to represent the fragment ion as one data point."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003630
name: Protein quantification
def: "Technique for determining the amount of proteins in a sample."
is_a: DIO:0003214
is_a: DIO:0003799

[Term]
id: DIO:0003631
name: Peptide identification
def: "Determination of peptide sequence from mass spectrum."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003632
name: Isotopic distributions calculation
def: "Calculate the isotope distribution of a given chemical species."
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0003633
name: Retention time prediction
def: "Prediction of retention time in a mass spectrometry experiment based on compositional and structural properties of the separated species."
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0003634
name: Label-free quantification
def: "Quantification without the use of chemical tags."
is_a: DIO:0003630

[Term]
id: DIO:0003635
name: Labeled quantification
def: "Quantification based on the use of chemical tags."
is_a: DIO:0003630

[Term]
id: DIO:0003636
name: MRM/SRM
def: "Quantification by Selected/multiple Reaction Monitoring workflow (XIC quantitation of precursor / fragment mass pair)."
is_a: DIO:0003630

[Term]
id: DIO:0003637
name: Spectral counting
def: "Calculate number of identified MS2 spectra as approximation of peptide / protein quantity."
is_a: DIO:0003634

[Term]
id: DIO:0003638
name: SILAC
def: "Quantification analysis using stable isotope labeling by amino acids in cell culture."
is_a: DIO:0003635

[Term]
id: DIO:0003639
name: iTRAQ
def: "Quantification analysis using the AB SCIEX iTRAQ isobaric labelling workflow, wherein 2-8 reporter ions are measured in MS2 spectra near 114 m/z."
is_a: DIO:0003635

[Term]
id: DIO:0003640
name: 18O labeling
def: "Quantification analysis using labeling based on 18O-enriched H2O."
is_a: DIO:0003635

[Term]
id: DIO:0003641
name: TMT-tag
def: "Quantification analysis using the Thermo Fisher tandem mass tag labelling workflow."
