is_a: DIO:0003631

[Term]
id: DIO:0003646
name: Peptide database search
def: "Determination of best matches between MS/MS spectrum and a database of protein or nucleic acid sequences."
is_a: DIO:0002421
is_a: DIO:0003631

[Term]
id: DIO:0003647
name: Blind peptide database search
def: "Peptide database search for identification of known and unknown PTMs looking for mass difference mismatches."
is_a: DIO:0003646

[Term]
id: DIO:0003649
name: Target-Decoy
def: "Statistical estimation of false discovery rate from score distribution for peptide-spectrum-matches, following a peptide database search, and by comparison to search results with a database containing incorrect information."
is_a: DIO:0002428
is_a: DIO:0003646

[Term]
id: DIO:0003658
name: Statistical inference
def: "Analyse data in order to deduce properties of an underlying distribution or population."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0003659
name: Regression analysis
def: "A statistical calculation to estimate the relationships among variables."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0003660
name: Metabolic network modelling
def: "Model a metabolic network. This can include 1) reconstruction to break down a metabolic pathways into reactions, enzymes, and other relevant information, and compilation of this into a mathematical model and 2) simulations of metabolism based on the model."
is_a: DIO:0003927
is_a: DIO:0003928

[Term]
id: DIO:0003661
name: SNP annotation
def: "Predict the effect or function of an individual single nucleotide polymorphism (SNP)."
is_a: DIO:0000361

[Term]
id: DIO:0003662
name: Ab-initio gene prediction
def: "Prediction of genes or gene components from first principles, i.e. without reference to existing genes."
is_a: DIO:0002454

[Term]
id: DIO:0003663
name: Homology-based gene prediction
def: "Prediction of genes or gene components by reference to homologous genes."
is_a: DIO:0002454

[Term]
id: DIO:0003664
name: Statistical modelling
def: "Construction of a statistical model, or a set of assumptions around some observed data, usually by describing a set of probability distributions which approximate the distribution of data."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0003666
name: Molecular surface comparison
def: "Compare two or more molecular surfaces."
is_a: DIO:0002483
is_a: DIO:0003351

[Term]
id: DIO:0003672
name: Gene functional annotation
def: "Annotate one or more sequences with functional information, such as cellular processes or metaobolic pathways, by reference to a controlled vocabulary - invariably the Gene Ontology (GO)."
is_a: DIO:0000361

[Term]
id: DIO:0003675
name: Variant filtering
def: "Variant filtering is used to eliminate false positive variants based for example on base calling quality, strand and position information, and mapping info."
is_a: DIO:0003218

[Term]
id: DIO:0003677
name: Differential binding analysis
def: "Identify binding sites in nucleic acid sequences that are statistically significantly differentially bound between sample groups."
is_a: DIO:0000415

[Term]
id: DIO:0003680
name: RNA-Seq analysis
def: "Analyze data from RNA-seq experiments."
is_a: DIO:0002495
is_a: DIO:0003921

[Term]
id: DIO:0003694
name: Mass spectrum visualisation
def: "Visualise, format or render a mass spectrum."
is_a: DIO:0000337

[Term]
id: DIO:0003695
name: Data filtering
def: "Filter a set of files or data items according to some property."
is_a: DIO:0002409

[Term]
id: DIO:0003703
name: Reference identification
def: "Identification of the best reference for mapping for a specific dataset from a list of potential references, when performing genetic variation analysis."
is_a: DIO:0003197

[Term]
id: DIO:0003704
name: Ion counting
def: "Label-free quantification by integration of ion current (ion counting)."
is_a: DIO:0003634

[Term]
id: DIO:0003705
name: Isotope-coded protein label
def: "Chemical tagging free amino groups of intact proteins with stable isotopes."
is_a: DIO:0003635

[Term]
id: DIO:0003715
name: Metabolic labeling
def: "Labeling all proteins and (possibly) all amino acids using C-13 or N-15 enriched grown medium or feed."
is_a: DIO:0003635

[Term]
id: DIO:0003730
name: Cross-assembly
def: "Construction of a single sequence assembly of all reads from different samples, typically as part of a comparative metagenomic analysis."
is_a: DIO:0000310

[Term]
id: DIO:0003731
name: Sample comparison
def: "The comparison of samples from a metagenomics study, for example, by comparison of metagenome shotgun reads or assembled contig sequences, by comparison of functional profiles, or some other method."
is_a: DIO:0002424

[Term]
id: DIO:0003741
name: Differential protein expression profiling
def: "The analysis, using proteomics techniques, to identify proteins whose encoding genes are differentially expressed under a given experimental setup."
is_a: DIO:0000314
is_a: DIO:0002997

[Term]
id: DIO:0003744
name: Multiple sample visualisation
def: "Visualise, format or render data arising from an analysis of multiple samples from a metagenomics/community experiment."
is_a: DIO:0000337

[Term]
id: DIO:0003745
name: Ancestral reconstruction
def: "The extrapolation of empirical characteristics of individuals or populations, backwards in time, to their common ancestors."
is_a: DIO:0000324

[Term]
id: DIO:0003755
name: PTM localisation
def: "Site localisation of post-translational modifications in peptide or protein mass spectra."
is_a: DIO:0003645

[Term]
id: DIO:0003760
name: Service management
def: "Operations concerning the handling and use of other tools."

[Term]
id: DIO:0003761
name: Service discovery
def: "An operation supporting the browsing or discovery of other tools and services."
is_a: DIO:0003760

[Term]
id: DIO:0003762
name: Service composition
def: "An operation supporting the aggregation of other services (at least two) into a functional unit, for the automation of some task."
is_a: DIO:0003760

[Term]
id: DIO:0003763
name: Service invocation
def: "An operation supporting the calling (invocation) of other tools and services."
is_a: DIO:0003760

[Term]
id: DIO:0003766
name: Weighted correlation network analysis
def: "A data mining method typically used for studying biological networks based on pairwise correlations between variables."
is_a: DIO:0003927

[Term]
id: DIO:0003767
name: Protein identification
def: "Identification of protein, for example from one or more peptide identifications by tandem mass spectrometry."
is_a: DIO:0002423
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003778
name: Text annotation
def: "Text annotation is the operation of adding notes, data and metadata, recognised entities and concepts, and their relations to a text (such as a scientific article)."
is_a: DIO:0000226

[Term]
id: DIO:0003791
name: Collapsing methods
def: "A method whereby data on several variants are "collapsed" into a single covariate based on regions such as genes."
is_a: DIO:0003197

[Term]
id: DIO:0003792
name: miRNA expression analysis
def: "The analysis of microRNAs (miRNAs) : short, highly conserved small noncoding RNA molecules that are naturally occurring plant and animal genomes."
is_a: DIO:0002495

[Term]
id: DIO:0003793
name: Read summarisation
def: "Counting and summarising the number of short sequence reads that map to genomic features."
is_a: DIO:0003921

[Term]
id: DIO:0003795
name: In vitro selection
def: "A technique whereby molecules with desired properties and function are isolated from libraries of random molecules, through iterative cycles of selection, amplification, and mutagenesis."
is_a: DIO:0003095

[Term]
id: DIO:0003797
name: Rarefaction
def: "The calculation of species richness for a number of individual samples, based on plots of the number of species as a function of the number of samples (rarefaction curves)."
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0003798
name: Read binning
def: "An operation which groups reads or contigs and assigns them to operational taxonomic units."
is_a: DIO:0003921

[Term]
id: DIO:0003799
name: Quantification
def: "Counting and measuring experimentally determined observations into quantities."

[Term]
id: DIO:0003800
name: RNA-Seq quantification
def: "Quantification of data arising from RNA-Seq high-throughput sequencing, typically the quantification of transcript abundances durnig transcriptome analysis in a gene expression study."
is_a: DIO:0003799

[Term]
id: DIO:0003801
name: Spectral library search
def: "Match experimentally measured mass spectrum to a spectrum in a spectral library or database."
is_a: DIO:0003631

[Term]
id: DIO:0003802
name: Data sorting
def: "Sort a set of files or data items according to some property."
is_a: DIO:0002409

[Term]
id: DIO:0003803
name: Natural product identification
def: "Mass spectra identification of compounds that are produced by living systems. Including polyketides, terpenoids, phenylpropanoids, alkaloids and antibiotics."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003809
name: DMR identification
def: "Identify and assess specific genes or regulatory regions of interest that are differentially methylated."
is_a: DIO:0003204

[Term]
id: DIO:0003840
name: Multilocus sequence typing
def: "Genotyping of multiple loci, typically characterizing microbial species isolates using internal fragments of multiple housekeeping genes."
is_a: DIO:0003196

[Term]
id: DIO:0003860
name: Spectrum calculation
def: "Calculate a theoretical mass spectrometry spectra for given sequences."
is_a: DIO:0000250
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:0003890
name: Trajectory visualization
def: "3D visualization of a molecular trajectory."
is_a: DIO:0000570

[Term]
id: DIO:0003891
name: Essential dynamics
def: "Compute Essential Dynamics (ED) on a simulation trajectory: an analysis of molecule dynamics using PCA (Principal Component Analysis) applied to the atomic positional fluctuations."
is_a: DIO:0000244
is_a: DIO:0002481

[Term]
id: DIO:0003893
name: Forcefield parameterisation
def: "Obtain force field parameters (charge, bonds, dihedrals, etc.) from a molecule, to be used in molecular simulations."
is_a: DIO:0002426

[Term]
id: DIO:0003894
name: DNA profiling
def: "Analyse DNA sequences in order to determine an individual&apos;s DNA characteristics, for example in criminal forensics, parentage testing and so on."
is_a: DIO:0002478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003896
name: Active site prediction
def: "Predict or detect active sites in proteins; the region of an enzyme which binds a substrate bind and catalyses a reaction."
is_a: DIO:0002575

[Term]
id: DIO:0003897
name: Ligand-binding site prediction
def: "Predict or detect ligand-binding sites in proteins; a region of a protein which reversibly binds a ligand for some biochemical purpose, such as transport or regulation of protein function."
is_a: DIO:0002575

[Term]
id: DIO:0003898
name: Metal-binding site prediction
def: "Predict or detect metal ion-binding sites in proteins."
is_a: DIO:0002575

[Term]
id: DIO:0003899
name: Protein-protein docking
def: "Model or simulate protein-protein binding using comparative modelling or other techniques."
is_a: DIO:0000478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003900
name: DNA-binding protein prediction
def: "Predict DNA-binding proteins."
is_a: DIO:0000389

[Term]
id: DIO:0003901
name: RNA-binding protein prediction
def: "Predict RNA-binding proteins."
is_a: DIO:0000389

[Term]
id: DIO:0003902
name: RNA binding site prediction
def: "Predict or detect RNA-binding sites in protein sequences."
is_a: DIO:0000420

[Term]
id: DIO:0003903
name: DNA binding site prediction
def: "Predict or detect DNA-binding sites in protein sequences."
is_a: DIO:0000420

[Term]
id: DIO:0003904
name: Protein disorder prediction
def: "Identify or predict intrinsically disordered regions in proteins."
is_a: DIO:0002423
is_a: DIO:0003092

[Term]
id: DIO:0003907
name: Information extraction
def: "Extract structured information from unstructured ("free") or semi-structured textual documents."
is_a: DIO:0000306

[Term]
id: DIO:0003908
name: Information retrieval
def: "Retrieve resources from information systems matching a specific information need."
is_a: DIO:0000306

[Term]
id: DIO:0003918
name: Genome analysis
def: "Study of genomic feature structure, variation, function and evolution at a genomic scale."
is_a: DIO:0002478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003919
name: Methylation calling
def: "The determination of cytosine methylation status of specific positions in a nucleic acid sequences (usually reads from a bisulfite sequencing experiment)."
is_a: DIO:0003204

[Term]
id: DIO:0003920
name: DNA testing
def: "The identification of changes in DNA sequence or chromosome structure, usually in the context of diagnostic tests for disease, or to study ancestry or phylogeny."
is_a: DIO:0002478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003921
name: Sequence read processing
def: "The processing of reads from high-throughput sequencing machines."
is_a: DIO:0002478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003925
name: Network visualisation
def: "Render (visualise) a network - typically a biological network of some sort."
is_a: DIO:0000337
is_a: DIO:0003927

[Term]
id: DIO:0003926
name: Pathway visualisation
def: "Render (visualise) a biological pathway."
is_a: DIO:0000337
is_a: DIO:0003928

[Term]
id: DIO:0003927
name: Network analysis
def: "Generate, process or analyse a biological network."
is_a: DIO:0002945

[Term]
id: DIO:0003928
name: Pathway analysis
def: "Generate, process or analyse a biological pathway."
is_a: DIO:0002945

[Term]
id: DIO:0003929
name: Metabolic pathway prediction
def: "Predict a metabolic pathway."
is_a: DIO:0002423
is_a: DIO:0003928

[Term]
id: DIO:0003933
name: Demultiplexing
def: "Assigning sequence reads to separate groups / files based on their index tag (sample origin)."
is_a: DIO:0003921

[Term]
id: DIO:0003935
name: Dimensionality reduction
def: "A process used in statistics, machine learning, and information theory that reduces the number of random variables by obtaining a set of principal variables."
is_a: DIO:0003438

[Term]
id: DIO:0003936
name: Feature selection
def: "A dimensionality reduction process that selects a subset of relevant features (variables, predictors) for use in model construction."
is_a: DIO:0003935

[Term]
id: DIO:0003937
name: Feature extraction
def: "A dimensionality reduction process which builds (ideally) informative and non-redundant values (features) from an initial set of measured data, to aid subsequent generalization, learning or interpretation."
is_a: DIO:0003935

[Term]
id: DIO:0003938
name: Virtual screening
def: "Virtual screening is used in drug discovery to identify potential drug compounds. It involves searching libraries of small molecules in order to identify those molecules which are most likely to bind to a drug target (typically a protein receptor or enzyme)."
is_a: DIO:0000482
is_a: DIO:0004009

[Term]
id: DIO:0003942
name: Tree dating
def: "The application of phylogenetic and other methods to estimate paleogeographical events such as speciation."
is_a: DIO:0000324

[Term]
id: DIO:0003946
name: Ecological modelling
def: "The development and use of mathematical models and systems analysis for the description of ecological processes, and applications such as the sustainable management of resources."
is_a: DIO:0000286
is_a: DIO:0002426

[Term]
id: DIO:0003947
name: Phylogenetic tree reconciliation
def: "Mapping between gene tree nodes and species tree nodes or branches, to analyse and account for possible differences between gene histories and species histories, explaining this in terms of gene-scale events such as duplication, loss, transfer etc."
is_a: DIO:0000325

[Term]
id: DIO:0003950
name: Selection detection
def: "The detection of genetic selection, or (the end result of) the process by which certain traits become more prevalent in a species than other traits."
is_a: DIO:0002478

[Term]
id: DIO:0003960
name: Principal component analysis
def: "A statistical procedure that uses an orthogonal transformation to convert a set of observations of possibly correlated variables into a set of values of linearly uncorrelated variables called principal components."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0003961
name: Copy number variation detection
def: "Identify where sections of the genome are repeated and the number of repeats in the genome varies between individuals."
is_a: DIO:0003228

[Term]
id: DIO:0003962
name: Deletion detection
def: "Identify deletion events causing the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals."
is_a: DIO:0003961

[Term]
id: DIO:0003963
name: Duplication detection
def: "Identify duplication events causing the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals."
is_a: DIO:0003961

[Term]
id: DIO:0003964
name: Complex CNV detection
def: "Identify copy number variations which are complex, e.g. multi-allelic variations that have many structural alleles and have rearranged multiple times in the ancestral genomes."
is_a: DIO:0003961

[Term]
id: DIO:0003965
name: Amplification detection
def: "Identify amplification events causing the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals."
is_a: DIO:0003961

[Term]
id: DIO:0003968
name: Adhesin prediction
def: "Predict adhesins in protein sequences."
is_a: DIO:0002429
is_a: DIO:0003092

[Term]
id: DIO:0004008
name: Protein design
def: "Design new protein molecules with specific structural or functional properties."
is_a: DIO:0002430

[Term]
id: DIO:0004009
name: Small molecule design
def: "The design of small molecules with specific biological activity, such as inhibitors or modulators for proteins that are of therapeutic interest. This can involve the modification of individual atoms, the addition or removal of molecular fragments, and the use reaction-based design to explore tractable synthesis options for the small molecule."
is_a: DIO:0002430

[Term]
id: DIO:0004031
name: Power test
def: "The estimation of the power of a test; that is the probability of correctly rejecting the null hypothesis when it is false."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0004032
name: DNA modification prediction
def: "The prediction of DNA modifications (e.g. N4-methylcytosine and N6-Methyladenine) using, for example, statistical models."
is_a: DIO:0000415

[Term]
id: DIO:0004033
name: Disease transmission analysis
def: "The analysis and simulation of disease transmission using, for example, statistical methods such as the SIR-model."
is_a: DIO:0002426
is_a: DIO:0002945
is_a: DIO:0003664

[Term]
id: DIO:0004034
name: Multiple testing correction
def: "The correction of p-values from multiple statistical tests to correct for false positives."
is_a: DIO:0002238

[Term]
id: DIO:0004042
name: Data management planning
def: "Data management planning is the process of creating and updating a data management plan (DMP) for a project or an organisation."

[Term]
id: DIO:0004043
name: Data digitisation
def: "Data digitisation is the process of converting analog data, text, or information into a digital format, appropriate for computational analysis and preservation."
is_a: DIO:0002409

[Term]
id: DIO:0004074
name: Compound identification
def: "Compound identification is the process of determining the chemical identity of compounds detected in analytical experiments such as mass spectrometry or NMR spectroscopy. Identification is typically achieved by matching experimental spectral or physicochemical features against reference databases, spectral libraries, or predicted molecular properties."
is_a: DIO:0003214

[Term]
id: DIO:9999997
name: Special images
def: "pegi3s special images"

[Term]
id: DIO:9999998
name: Dev tools
def: "Developer tools such as base images"

[Term]
id: DIO:9999999
name: Pipelines
def: "Pipelines"

